  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are two events such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"right\"><mi>A</mi></menclose><msup><mi>B</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><menclose notation=\"right\"><mi>B</mi></menclose><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
